ing against source: P03 emits choice_group=null, retains separate parent constraints, and describes allFixed/allFloating as non-exhaustive conditional views.\",\n  \"Run python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_accounting_p04.py' -v. Require every catalogued obligation to execute without failures, errors, skips, duplicate IDs or missing observations.\",\n  \"Compare complete feasible assignment sets against an independent Fraction enumerator replaying original templates and observations without production lowering or Z3. Perturb identifiers, declaration order, openings, observations, rates, coefficients and slot limits.\",\n  \"Through the actual P03 compiler and P04 adapter, verify alpha=1/2 remains feasible in the parent; allFixed admits only alpha=1 within its query; subsequent parent queries remain unchanged. Add overlapping views alpha<=3/4 and alpha>=1/4: their intersection survives, declaration order preserves feasibility, and view labels neither multiply coverage cells nor create weights. Contradictory view selection makes only that conditional query infeasible.\",\n  \"Check exact debt bounds [5,7]; rounded-case infimum 199/40 attained and supremum 1407/200 unattained; negative ties, half-even parity, posting quantisation, integer gaps, empty strict domains, constant and unbounded objectives. Check feasibility before closed-relaxation bounds.\",\n  \"Test linked choices across accounts/dates, shared observation identity, incompatible marginal extrema, source-labelled conflicts, unresolved obligations, unsupported nonlinear operations, zero-work budgets and interruption after a completed cell. Inject backend Unknown deterministically, avoiding timing-dependent assertions.\",\n  \"Test exact posterior weights 3/11 and 8/11, repeated-information rejection, zero-probability conditioning, unweighted-summary rejection and retained unresolved/default mass. Test all six uncertainty admissions and grouping invalidation after rate, maturity, scenario or horizon changes.\",\n  \"Run python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_accounting_p03.py' -v without regenerating accepted P03 outputs.\",\n  \"Run python3 -B scripts/check_accounting_p04.py --output-dir data/accounting-master/deliverables/P04 --execution-inventory <existing supervisor inventory>. Resolve the placeholder before execution; require successful checks, matching hashes, complete observations and unchanged protected inputs.\"\n]\nresiduals [\n  \"No P04 implementation or acceptance evidence exists yet; the required conformance.json, result.md and tests/test_accounting_p04.py are absent.\",\n  \"The execution-entry inventory must be supplied by the supervisor before implementation protection checks can pass.\",\n  \"General disclosure interpretation, template discovery, arbitrary-history completeness, nonlinear solving, continuous probabilistic inference, unbounded integer search and general aggregation equivalence remain unsupported.\",\n  \"Selected numerical consistency and synthetic admission tests establish neither full accounting validity nor empirical forecast validity or human acceptance.\",\n  \"MC01\\u2013MC35 and G1\\u2013G18 retain their wider obligations. This slice supplies bounded evidence for MC08\\u2013MC12, MC18 and MC26 without claiming global closure.\"\n]\nEvidence paths missing: []\nPlan word count: 1377\nZ3 version: 4.16.0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
